        {
          "description": "Request a higher daily transfer limit for an account. This NEVER changes the limit: it files an approval request that a human supervisor must decide. Policy (cap 100000, must be an increase, one pending request per account) is checked by the system. Returns SUBMITTED_FOR_HUMAN_APPROVAL with a request_id, or NOT_SUBMITTED with the reason.",
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "request_limit_increase",
            "handlerDescription": "Request a higher daily transfer limit for an account. This NEVER changes the limit: it files an approval request that a human supervisor must decide. Policy (cap 100000, must be an increase, one pending request per account) is checked by the system. Returns SUBMITTED_FOR_HUMAN_APPROVAL with a request_id, or NOT_SUBMITTED with the reason.",
